📝Official Guide: https://googlewhiskguide.com/

Google Whisk is an experimental AI image generation tool that lets you create visuals without typing a single prompt. Instead of relying on text, it uses visual cues and references, making it perfect for creators who prefer a more intuitive and hands-on approach.

It's not just AI images, you can use it to:

▶️ Product Mockups: You can create product mockups by choosing a subject like t-shirts, mugs, or phone cases, setting a background, and selecting a style.


▶️ Social Media Graphics: Create eye-catching designs for Instagram, Facebook, or Twitter by selecting relevant subjects, scenes, and styles.


▶️ Event Posters: Design promotional materials for events, parties, or announcements with custom subjects and styles.

